  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2020-2025 Hyundai Palisade (Fits Bench Seats)\nDoes not fit vehicles with vinyl flooring\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: These 3 Rows floor mats & Cargo Liner are fit for 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025 Hyundai Palisade w/ Bench Seats; 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and back.\nEco-Safe Certification: Our TPE Floor Mats & Cargo Trunk Liner are recyclable and durable; Eco-safe material easily withstands the rigor of daily abuse for long-lasting performance in both arctic cold and tropical heat\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: Uniquely designed channels and raised edge can effectively trap snow, mud, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean; Built-in retainer clips to firmly grip the mat and prevent slipping when wet.\nEasy To Clean: These floor mats simply shake the dirt out of the textured skid-resistant surface or spray down with a hose; Cleaning up daily wear and tear off our Palisade car mats is a breeze\nWhy Choose YITAMOTOR: Our floor mats are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard to your vehicle.",
